{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1788975791,"nonce":"c5CRwcjEWEsi6QFMOYqgqbMdDAY=","title":"Delete the pre-JIT module path and drop the hlbc dependency","message":"`crates/ash/src/{module.rs, functions.rs, values.rs}` (916 + 574 + 209 lines)\nreference only each other and `types.rs`'s `FunPtr` enum, and `AshModule` is\nconstructed in exactly one place -- its own unit test. It is the pre-`jit/`\nprototype: `translate_opcode` covers about twelve opcodes, bails on the rest, and\nnever implemented jump targets.\n\nRemoving the three files, the `FunPtr` enum with its `use hlbc::types::...`, the\nthree `pub mod` lines in `lib.rs`, and the `hlbc` entry in Cargo.toml eliminates\nthe last dependency on an upstream unmaintained for two years -- without forking\nor vendoring anything.","files":null}]}